tor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>KAMIGATA, YASUO</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>KONDOH, SEIICHI</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>MATSUZAWA, JUN</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>TERAZAKI, HIROKI</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>UCHIDA, TAKESHI</name></addressbook></inventor></inventors></parties></bibliographic-data><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="EN"><p>An abrasive liquid for a metal comprising (1) an oxidizing agent for a metal, (2) a dissolving agent for an oxidized metal, (3) a first protecting film-forming agent such as an amino acid or an azole which adsorbs physically on the surface of the metal and/or forms a chemical bond, to thereby form a protecting film, (4) a second protecting film-forming agent such as polyacrylic acid, polyamido acid or a salt thereof which assists the first protecting film-forming agent in forming a protecting film and (5) water; and a method for polishing.</p></abstract><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="FR"><p>L'invention se rapporte à un liquide abrasif pour le polissage d'un métal, qui comporte (1) un agent d'oxydation destiné à un métal, (2) un agent dissolvant destiné à un métal oxydé, (3) un premier agent susceptible de former un film protecteur tel qu'un acide aminé ou un azole qui est physiquement adsorbé à la surface du métal et/ou forme une liaison chimique, de manière à créer un film protecteur, (4) un second agent susceptible de former un film protecteur tel qu'un acide polyacrylique, un acide polyamide ou un sel de ces acides, qui facilite la formation d'un film protecteur par le premier agent susceptible de former un film protecteur et (5) de l'eau. L'invention se rapporte également à un procédé de polissage.</p></abstract><copyright>User acknowledges that the Information Retrieval Facility (IRF) and its third party providers retain all right, title and interest in and to this xml under applicable copyright laws. User acquires no ownership rights to this xml including but not limited to its format. User hereby accepts the terms and conditions of the Licence Agreement set forth at http://www.ir-facility.org/legal/marec/data_licence</copyright></patent-document>